{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-fixed-point-algorithm.md","title":"Effective Character Construction of a GL Fixed Point","display":"df-fixed-point-algorithm — Effective Character Construction of a GL Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-fixed-point-algorithm","aliases":["89-df-fixed-point-algorithm"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-fixed-point-algorithm — Effective Character Construction of a GL Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-characters]]","[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-df-modal-degree]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]","[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-fixed-point-algorithm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-fixed-point-algorithm</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point-algorithm — Effective Character Construction of a GL Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9951d1dd53a3ed60\" href=\"?note=9951d1dd53a3ed60\" title=\"89-df-modal-characters\">89-df-modal-characters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04ea1c6ff126f884\" href=\"?note=04ea1c6ff126f884\" title=\"89-df-modal-degree\">89-df-modal-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=b_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(n=b_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 升序枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}_Q(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}_Q(n)\\)</span> 为有限 character 集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为已有有界反模型判定函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigvee\\)</span> 为有限有序析取，空值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 是下文引入的二参数公式函数。</li>\n<li>本条的有限公式排序使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}\">\\(\\operatorname{sort}\\)</span>；其他有限指标序列仍按已声明的自然数顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_{A,p}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(n)\\mid\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}((\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land C)\\to p)=1\\},\\\\\nH_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{t-1}\\rangle,\n\\quad\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{t-1}\\rangle=\\operatorname{sort}(S_{A,p}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_{A,p}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(n)\\mid\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}((\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land C)\\to p)=1\\},\\\\\nH_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{t-1}\\rangle,\n\\quad\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{t-1}\\rangle=\\operatorname{sort}(S_{A,p}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 115–116；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>sort 使用 character 定义中同一固定可计算语法编码；它只给有限集合唯一有序列，不引入语义选择。候选集合有限，每次 GL 判定终止，故这是总可计算构造，值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；不包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，也不添加其他字母。空候选返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。character 数可形成指数塔，本定义不给多项式或 PSPACE 的构造复杂度承诺。正确性由下一条度数界定理证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-characters","status":"resolved","id":"9951d1dd53a3ed60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-characters]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的有限公式排序使用 [[89-df-modal-godel-code]] 的 $\\operatorname{sort}$；其他有限指标序列仍按已声明的自然数顺序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"n=b_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}_Q(n)","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sort}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_{A,p}&\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(n)\\mid\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}((\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land C)\\to p)=1\\},\\\\\nH_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)&\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{t-1}\\rangle,\n\\quad\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{t-1}\\rangle=\\operatorname{sort}(S_{A,p}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":2016,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["9951d1dd53a3ed60","138d8c34e0370a6b","04ea1c6ff126f884","95a48b6ae42f7e48","3bbdf6f3419b5805","ca21b68a25f1afc2","ff66b5cf43748aff"]}